    <string name="routing_consent">I allow the imported profile to route these apps’ permitted traffic through its configured proxies when enabled. Proxy operators may observe metadata and unencrypted traffic. Credentials stay encrypted on this device and are excluded from rule backups. Import replaces the previous profile and saves disabled. No inspection stores or CA keys are passed to the transport. This library runs under WAYD’s app UID; it is not a separate security sandbox.</string>
